Experiment: pwn-get-it
Configuration: Broken service Docker
Source: docker logs ctf-get-it-service

Observed error:
socat E initgroups(get_it, 1000): Operation not permitted

Cause:
The container was started with --cap-drop ALL.
This prevented socat from switching to the restricted get_it user.

Correction:
The service was restarted with:
--cap-drop ALL
--cap-add SETUID
--cap-add SETGID

Verification:
After the correction, the service displayed its original challenge
startup output and the agent completed a verified solve.

Note:
This is an excerpt reconstructed from the observed terminal output,
not a complete original Docker log.
